      "writtenOn": "2024-12-20T16:00:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "IIUC this line will be called when the ConnectivityService  is initialized ([ref](https://source.corp.google.com/h/googleplex-android/platform/packages/modules/Connectivity/+/839d33cff65b37263042ce749833f8c9fd68e21c:service/src/com/android/server/ConnectivityService.java;l\u003d1876-1877;bpv\u003d1;bpt\u003d0;drc\u003db960664fa87446d1aad3309914e0852b01c961cd)).\n\nThe callback itself should be called every time the permission for any installed app is changed, whether it\u0027s in the permission dialog or in the device settings, after the PermissionService updates the permission state.",
      "parentUuid": "bb0e33fb_d26e7c26",
      "revId": "91e10242fc4e12da4127850cfe99f180e9977ca0",
